Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Satsang with Mooji
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.99,0:03:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,perchance, I hadn't taken\NJonathan Joestar's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not have survived\Nfor 100 long years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this body seems to be\Nlinked to Jonathan's descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it that concerns you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar's bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They suspect my existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.73,0:04:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And this new power I acquired\Nfrom having Jonathan's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But this stand of mine, it appears to\Naffect the bodies of his descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength and weakness are simply\Ntwo sides of the same coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, Lord Dio,\Nplease feel reassured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already taken the necessary actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly! Holly! Holly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:04:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's wrong, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to catch up on my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.11,0:05:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely certain\Nthat you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I'm fine, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You simply worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.23,0:05:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that boy Jotaro made\Nus all worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go rest up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, silly papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.34,0:05:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you need? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if we'd receive some\Nreply from the Speed Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know where the fax machine is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the fax is in the room\Nacross from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.93,0:05:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If something comes in,\NI'll bring it to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where's Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,At school, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:06:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jojo, how come you\Ndidn't come to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, stop trying to rub\Nthose against Jojo's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a problem, ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, flat chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want your flat chest telling\Nme that, either, you flat chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jojo? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Choo-choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.85,0:07:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A cut on my knee. What's\Ngoing on? Did I get
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,cut by that branch no that's not it it was
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,cut before i fell that's why i lost my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,footing on the steps it\Ncan't be a where is he
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he came this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Choo-choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Choo-choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I said to myself, he's hurt, so I\Nwent back to get a bandage for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:08:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.63,0:09:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no girl's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl has been possessed by my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,By your stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Noriyaki Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:10:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And my stand's name is Hierophant Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, I pledged my loyalty to Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.35,0:10:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, attacking my stand will\Nend up injuring that girl. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She really seems to care a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:10:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's been dragged out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it's the kind of stand\Nthat has to possess someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see those grip marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.45,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me choke you just a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And then when you pass out, I'll\Ndrag your ass home to the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There, you can talk all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,About Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You dragged out my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're going to regret that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you actually managed to put your\Nguard up before Hierophant could strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand hates to be in open spaces, so\Nhe always tends to lurk behind something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.89,0:12:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, if you drag\Nhim out, he'll get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.99,0:12:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you that I would make you\Nregret that you dragged out my stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.69,0:12:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think you've seen\Neverything, Hierophant can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Those things that look like\Nthe bodily fluids of my
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,hierophant green are actually\Nvisions of destructive energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,sacrificing yourself to protect a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How foolish you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you\Ncan do with that body?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like a sandbag before a boxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you stand up only\Nto be beaten down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty much everyone's written\Nme off as a delinquent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm always beating up\Nguys who challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And handing out lessons to those stuck-up\Nmorons that call themselves teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.91,0:13:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But even I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,can sense the disgusting evil in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Evil? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,An evil person is a coward\Nwho would take advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.97,0:14:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,of the weak and use them\Nto fight his battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about\Nthat woman over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the Vanquished be the evil,\Nand the victor be the just.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How you get there doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Vanquished is the evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of this talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Vanquished is the evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.35,0:14:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the evil one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What a powerful stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.99,0:15:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.47,0:15:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Chotaro, this is no fault of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.35,0:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the reason why\Nthis young man pledged
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,his loyalty to Dio and then attacked you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That reason is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.21,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is a bud of flesh\Ncreated from Dio's cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A bud of flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, approximately four\Nmonths ago, in Cairo, Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.71,0:16:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I too was approached by Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My occupation is fortune-telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a shop in Cairo, Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.49,0:16:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,On my way home from the shop one evening,\Nhe suddenly appeared in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,his icy gaze creeping into my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hair of spun gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Translucent white skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd already heard about him from Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar So I immediately\Nrecognized him as Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.89,0:17:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard you possess an ability\Nthat ordinary people don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.07,0:17:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be extremely pleased if you\Nwould be so kind as to show it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It was then I felt the fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The words he spoke were somehow\Nrelaxing and were dangerously sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and therefore even more terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran with no thought of fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.39,0:17:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,a bud of flesh would have\Nbeen implanted in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like this unfortunate young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have pledged my\Nabsolute loyalty to Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, my brain would have been consumed\Nin a few years and I would have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin isn't dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.45,0:18:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing will attack and infiltrate the\Nbrain of anyone who tries to remove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pull this sucker out\Nwithout damaging his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,D... Dio...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you but why don't move if i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,get this just right you're dead meat
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.21,0:20:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, this is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.95,0:20:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wait and have faith in my grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.77,0:20:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, neither Jotaro nor\Nhis stand tremble one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.71,0:20:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,More precisely than a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,More powerfully, he is\Nslowly working it loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician's Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.21,0:21:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you risk your own life to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.03,0:21:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I knew that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.91,0:21:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.61,0:22:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly! Holly! Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.23,0:22:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.97,0:22:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The one thing that I feared\Nmost has finally come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.69,0:22:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was strange\Nthat because of Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.85,0:22:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,stand abilities had\Nappeared in Jotaro and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But nothing had happened to Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.83,0:23:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.74,0:23:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,a stand is called forth by\Na user's spiritual strength
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and pressed into action by\Ntheir fighting instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.89,0:23:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But Miss Holly has a\Nquiet and gentle nature
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.49,0:23:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,that is not well suited\Nto controlling a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.15,0:23:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, even worse than that,\Nit's actually done her harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.81,0:23:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We've worried that she did\Nnot have the power to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.25,0:23:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Worried that she didn't have\Nthe power to battle Dio's spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.77,0:23:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known people who died because of\Nthe damage caused by their own stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.01,0:23:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,However, in the case of Miss Holly,\NI believe that there is still hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.01,0:24:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.95,0:24:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.79,0:24:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat Dio and break this cursed spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That is true, but where is Dio right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.95,0:24:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not even have a clue\Nabout where to search.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.41,0:24:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nile, Tzitzi, inhabits the\NNile River regions of Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.63,0:24:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Specifically,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.54,0:24:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the one with a striped pattern on its\Nlegs is called the Aswan Tzitzi Fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.25,0:24:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a fax from someplace\Ncalled the Speed Wagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.61,0:24:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that he's still in!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.27,0:24:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In Egypt, all along he was still in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.01,0:24:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the Aswan region.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.01,0:24:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Three months ago, my family\Nand I were traveling in Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.23,0:24:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and that was where and when I met Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.23,0:25:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio's existence terrified me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.15,0:25:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and I succumbed to his attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.29,0:25:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again will I allow myself\Nto go through that misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.57,0:25:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I'm going to Egypt too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.83,0:25:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But why? Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.51,0:25:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.01,0:25:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew why myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.67,0:25:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me return to my senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.65,0:25:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's reason enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.25,0:25:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Holly, I promise I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.93,0:25:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.97,0:25:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never know when the\Nenemy might attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.57,0:25:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So to avoid involving\Ninnocent people in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.51,0:26:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be going aboard the\NSpeedwagon Foundation's private jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.57,0:26:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.95,0:26:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we leave, please allow me\Nto give your stand a proper name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.77,0:26:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, from this tarot deck,\Nchoose any one card that you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.99,0:26:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Star card.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.59,0:26:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I will name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.15,0:26:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stand shall be called Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.35,0:26:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What this card implies will be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.71,0:26:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the journey we are about to begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.75,0:26:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.35,0:27:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, they figured it\Nout, my current location.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.65,0:27:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.11,0:29:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
